      "function": "demonstration",
      "scene_type": "gritwerk_versus",
      "duration_hint": 18,
      "spoken": "So how well does it hold up? In 2006, Gollwitzer and Paschal Sheeran pooled ninety-four independent tests. The average effect on reaching goals was zero point six five, a medium to large effect. The plans helped people get started and stay on track.",
      "data": {
        "headline": "How well does it hold?",
        "link": "pooled in 2006",
        "cards": [
